+# frozen discovery/boundary cells and 12 independent holdouts. The *_controls
+# experiments measure exclusions and selector boundaries without mixing them
+# into a proposed production rule's aggregate. D64 changes only the output
+# epilogue; D128 changes only CTA topology.
